        "tex": "\\begin{equation}\n  \\vect{y} = \\Phi\\vect{w} + \\vect{\\varepsilon},\n  \\qquad \\Phi_{ij} = \\phi_j(t_i)\n  \\label{eq:matrix_model}\n\\end{equation}",
