        "tex": "\\begin{equation}\n  \\mathcal{L}(\\vect{w}) = \\frac{1}{2n}\\sum_{i=1}^{n}\n    \\left(y_i-\\vect{\\phi}(t_i)^\\top\\vect{w}\\right)^2\n  \\label{eq:squared_loss}\n\\end{equation}",
